lines:
Hoo, boy... Master Rank Contests,
here I come.{be01}
The world will know that my dearest
Pokémon is the cutest being in all{be00}
existence. The time has come!{be00}
Uheheheh.

When you get up to the Master Rank
Contests, you get your eyes opened{be00}
to striking Pokémon that just scream{be00}
to be painted.

I accept registrations only from four
linked players for a Pokémon Contest.{be01}
Anyone with a Contest Pass may enter.{be01}
You may obtain a Contest Pass at the
Normal Rank Contest Hall in{be00}
Verdanturf Town free of charge.{be01}
Please obtain a Contest Pass and
come again.

Oh, dear! They still haven’t given
you a Contest Pass?{be01}
You should go get one in Verdanturf
Town right away.{be01}
It’s such a thrill having others see
Pokémon that you’ve raised with care{be00}
and love.

Hello!{be01}
This is the reception counter for
Pokémon Contests.{be01}
Oh? It appears that you don’t have
a Pokéblock Case yet.{be01}
In that case, we need to provide you
with this!

好的，
这样就没问题了……{be01}
您好！{be01}
这里是宝可梦华丽大赛的
接待前台。

A Pokémon Contest involves four
Trainers entering one Pokémon each
in competitive judging.{be01}
A Contest has two stages of judging,
primary and secondary.{be01}
Primary judging is a popularity poll
involving the audience.{be01}
Secondary judging features appeals
by the Pokémon using their moves.{be01}
Plan appeals carefully to earn the
most attention of the Judge and
excite the audience.
Do your best to stand out.{be01}
The primary and secondary scores are
added at the end.{be01}
The Pokémon garnering the highest
score is declared the winner.

一共有5个类别的比赛。{be01}
分别是帅气、美丽、可爱、
聪明，以及强壮！{be01}
请为您报名的宝可梦
选择最适合它的类别！

There are four ranks of Pokémon
Contests.{be01}
Normal, Super, Hyper, and Master
are the four ranks.{be01}
In the Normal Rank, any Pokémon may
enter.{be01}
Any Pokémon that won a Normal Rank
Contest may move up to the Super Rank
in the same category.{be01}
In the same way, a Super Rank winner
can move up to the Hyper Rank, and
a Hyper Rank winner can advance to
the Master Rank in the same category.{be01}
A Pokémon that won in the Master Rank
may compete in the Master Rank as
often as its Trainer wants.

Anyone with a Contest Pass may enter.{be01}
You may obtain a Contest Pass at the
Normal Rank Contest HALL in
VERDANTURF TOWN free of charge.{be01}
Please obtain a Contest Pass and
come again.

Anyone with a Contest Pass may enter.{be01}
If you don’t have one, I can issue one
for you right now.{be01}
Would you like me to issue you a
Contest Pass?

Oh?{be01}
We’ve already issued you a Contest
Pass, {0100:0}.{be01}
Please come back with your Contest
Pass.

Oh, but that Ribbon...{be01}
Your Pokémon has won this Contest
before, hasn’t it?{be01}
Would you like to enter it in this
Contest anyway?
